Source: pg-improv
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), clang-19, pkg-config, libssl-dev, libicu-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/gregburd/improv

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-improv
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Incremental multidimensional models over PostgreSQL tables
 Bind tables to multidimensional models, evaluate formulas and what-if
 scenarios, and maintain result tables incrementally. Logical synchronization
 requires preloading pg_improv and enabling logical decoding. Numeric model
 values use double precision.
